### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### Variables y login automático
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### Login Lopez (guarda el token en variable)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "lopez@vet.com",
  "password": "mipassword"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("tokenLopez", response.body.token);
%}

### Login Perez (guarda el token en variable)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "perez@vet.com",
  "password": "miclave123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("tokenPerez", response.body.token);
%}


